  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Veermok</defName>
    <label>veermok</label>
    <description>Veermoks were a ferocious species of clawed and fanged primates native to the planet Naboo (but with sizeable populations on both Eriadau and Xirl). Living in swamps and moist woodlands, veermoks were arboreal creatures. They were also solitary and aggressive creatures, spending the majority of their lives without others of their kind. Their popularity amongst big game hunters meant they were exported and established on multiple worlds in the Mid and Outer Rim.</description>
